    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY:</strong><br>After receiving a distressing email from your Brother, you travel to his last known location.<br>The only thing that greets you is a one-man Submersible.<br>Diving into the depths below, you explore various mysteries the ocean has to offer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The once thriving, under-ocean research center now lies abandoned, waiting for anyone brave enough to explore it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What treasures and secrets will you discover down below? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive as deep as you can, collecting treasure and artifacts along the way! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive and escape the ocean's inhabitants as you traverse the rocky coral reefs, sunken ships, and abandoned outposts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything you discover is randomly generated so no two dives are the same!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the money you've earned to get new equipment, upgrade your vessel, and deck out your dock!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate and discover what lies at the bottom of the ocean!<br><br><strong>There are over 70 unique monsters in the ocean!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY:</strong><br>After receiving a distressing email from your Brother, you travel to his last known location.<br>The only thing that greets you is a one-man Submersible.<br>Diving into the depths below, you explore various mysteries the ocean has to offer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The once thriving, under-ocean research center now lies abandoned, waiting for anyone brave enough to explore it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What treasures and secrets will you discover down below? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive as deep as you can, collecting treasure and artifacts along the way! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive and escape the ocean's inhabitants as you traverse the rocky coral reefs, sunken ships, and abandoned outposts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything you discover is randomly generated so no two dives are the same!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the money you've earned to get new equipment, upgrade your vessel, and deck out your dock!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate and discover what lies at the bottom of the ocean!<br><br><strong>There are over 70 unique monsters in the ocean!</strong></p>",
